&_nc_ohc=-jKlq9cJAxwQ7kNvwFKeMdD&_nc_oc=AdpiW7fRl8Gf_tez2JIGPDzOx2G9TPgGqPWJecQpx7NfM0rW-R2-hIe5hs3k4KSSahA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQN8h_O6KJM1jgITPgmtDSdIJblJt20HnZeMknqMS62_zA&oe=6AE49183"}]}, "id": "4356029028044012", "locale": "pt_BR", "screenshots": [{"file_name": "home_10_Quest.png", "id": "1471900691162468", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499307435_1471900694495801_4829947570561919049_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=4Wk1mmWndqAQ7kNvwHaq3Jn&_nc_oc=AdpfYTN7usUgnv7mWpcBwvlD_LOZ_VtZk0JdqRYIFMZt6KgQrKoD4oXv7uuAXomudHQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMhOD2bwI-AyKP6CzbHdrFsqeoqpwiV6mTRLXaUKGWs4w&oe=6AE4C04B"}, {"file_name": "settings_10_Quest.png", "id": "1391193859145570", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499308010_1391193862478903_5269474807905197381_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=mYuaeUr1T9EQ7kNvwGevkA4&_nc_oc=Adqfit2w64mcL0A_Ahhka55KuDqSyOSqabVwNtBZfdh4UQNJAyKOCUe7u4nZW7XLvTg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMbzl80vCmHmdCP8EL-8V_g5Gn43P5xWVgpZvSrR0ZADg&oe=6AE49EC1"}, {"file_name": "home_10_settings_Quest.png", "id": "890412220264365", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499310817_890412223597698_6569410573752295327_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=a6tnohcS1UwQ7kNvwFUbTAr&_nc_oc=AdosqXK0fXanc9b8936b92eWfYxJhJKfQJdDnE5hvXJyuwI4lAv_fOsIdisSvOJedgQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQN_D1iEaBXfh-Gg0rMdy9k7Hno2FNOD7D-Bn5JVq2CV3Q&oe=6AE4B804"}, {"file_name": "edit_10_Quest.png", "id": "1209432111385989", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499310731_1209432114719322_5500871760126419425_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Mo1PkExXRj4Q7kNvwFdfqP_&_nc_oc=AdoIvkQdxDvL6vV2TDl34d_VXdjfh_UBk2VnSRybMKXN50ctv4_NA5TCsu-qs1yRwhc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNe_2hagY4QV9P8AFeQ9wIgRMTSdbMCNe7L3ctX8Br51w&oe=6AE4ABC1"}, {"file_name": "player_10_Quest.png", "id": "908261954943342", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499303746_908261961610008_2600051788214719246_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Du3Yuk1zA18Q7kNvwHlpM7d&_nc_oc=AdqPREAkzCGKHRxpq4q_1TSF3vcasvjnojCKao7jF8Xmo4aJxJQUKSaKnG7C23qU16k&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOrLMhJKa5K88Qbutn7w-UnO44ZqsZcQaSbf-3TuREYNg&oe=6AE4A062"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Cifraria", "keywords": ["Viol\u00e3o", "Ukulele", "Cifras", "Letras", "Biblioteca"], "long_description": "O **Cifraria** \u00e9 uma biblioteca profissional de m\u00fasicas e de gerenciamento de cifras desenvolvido em Flutter.\nCriado para m\u00fasicos de todos os n\u00edveis, oferece uma experi\u00eancia fluida para gerenciar, transpor e praticar suas m\u00fasicas favoritas, tanto no celular quanto no Quest.\n\n\u2728 **Funcionalidades**\n\n\ud83d\udcc2 **Arquitetura Inteligente**: Organize suas m\u00fasicas em pastas personalizadas com uma barra lateral em glassmorphism (efeito de vidro) para um visual premium e moderno.\n\n\ud83d\udcdc **Gest\u00e3o de Repert\u00f3rios**: Crie listas personalizadas e organize as m\u00fasicas na ordem exata da sua apresenta\u00e7\u00e3o.\n\n\ud83d\udcf2 **Compartilhamento Pro**: Exporte seus repert\u00f3rios atrav\u00e9s da extens\u00e3o exclusiva .cifraria via apps de mensagem ou utilize o QR Code para que outro dispositivo com o app recrie a lista e as m\u00fasicas automaticamente.\n\n\ud83d\udd04 **Transposi\u00e7\u00e3o Instant\u00e2nea**: Mude o tom das m\u00fasicas em tempo real com um motor de transposi\u00e7\u00e3o robusto.\n\n\u2601\ufe0f **Sincroniza\u00e7\u00e3o em Nuvem (Google Drive)**: Fa\u00e7a backup e restaure com seguran\u00e7a toda a sua biblioteca, incluindo pastas e m\u00fasicas favoritas.\n\n\ud83d\udcf1 **Pronto para o Meta Quest**: Modo paisagem otimizado e dimensionamento de interface para um ambiente de pr\u00e1tica imersivo e sem distra\u00e7\u00f5es no Meta Quest.\n\n\ud83d\udcc4 **Importa\u00e7\u00e3o Multiformato**: Importe cifras da web (extra\u00e7\u00e3o com apenas um clique) ou de arquivos locais (PDF e DOCX).\n\n\ud83c\udfb6 **Cifras Interativas**: Acordes clic\u00e1veis com gera\u00e7\u00e3o autom\u00e1tica de diagramas, com suporte para Viol\u00e3o e Ukulele.\n\n\u26a1 **Foco em Performance**: Banco de dados local para carregamento instant\u00e2neo e funcionamento 100% offline.", "short_description": "O Cifraria \u00e9 uma biblioteca profissional de m\u00fasicas e o seu aplicativo definitivo para gerenciar cifras."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "icon_app_cifraria_1440.png", "id": "25137093062632621", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499303140_25137093065965954_5340243871155545084_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=04rgDHoYJksQ7kNvwHnu7Ow&_nc_oc=Adr5QaIO78rEnz98QavFpsEhFTcE7K2eSYWKguec-76Re196Db3L-gNReGF_UP4bfow&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNfRhsAPTjdPxhH6FVWlIu7g7qeFkY1BDPIk71xLradPQ&oe=6AE4A6A4"}, {"file_name": "icon_app_cifraria_512.png", "id": "1950929249182186", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499308090_1950929252515519_3579238828299289210_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=LOKEJiYU0hQQ7kNvwHd-PLh&_nc_oc=AdqhpsHyHbtAzAKSgW5JOuMbEFXR5npQ5PmHkXEtNoOj1yQq-jTmKf2zGUpDIzDuR7c&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQN03MvnVV3DmmPkWrSXK4kmFd_2CfoNB2wLM_GT3TmuEg&oe=6AE4A97C"}, {"file_name": "cover art cifraria.png", "id": "1221596580110880", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499307422_1221596583444213_1996221161851683055_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=77sArrp07XgQ7kNvwFa